## Revenue Calculation (SHOW YOUR WORK)

**Current Calculation (at $83.5M TVL):**

```
Step 1: TVL from DefiLlama API
  - Total TVL: $83.5M

Step 2: Estimate collateral yield
  - Average collateral yield assumption: 9%
  - Based on mix of T-bills (4-5%), DeFi lending (6-10%), strategies (10-15%)

Step 3: Calculate total yield generated
  - Total yield = $83.5M × 9% = $7.515M annually

Step 4: Apply protocol fee (estimated 15%)
  - Protocol revenue = $7.515M × 15% = $1.127M annually
  - To srUSD/wsrUSD holders = $7.515M × 85% = $6.388M annually

RESULT: ~$1.1M annual protocol revenue at $83.5M TVL
```

**Note:** This is an ESTIMATE. Actual fee % and yield vary. Update when official fee documentation available.

