## Update Checklist

Before publishing any Reservoir update:

1. **Fetch from DefiLlama API:**
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/protocol/reservoir-protocol`
   - Extract: TVL total, TVL by chain, peak TVL, audits

2. **Fetch from CoinGecko API:**
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/reservoir` (DAM token)
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/reservoir-rusd` (rUSD)
   - Extract: Price, market cap, supply, volume, ATH/ATL

3. **Update report metrics:**
   - [ ] TVL total and by chain
   - [ ] DAM token price and market cap
   - [ ] rUSD peg status
   - [ ] Recalculate revenue estimates with new TVL

4. **Update footnotes:**
   - [ ] Note "retrieved via [API name] API" for all API data
   - [ ] Include exact values in footnote descriptions

5. **Citation check:**
   - [ ] Every footnote `[^N]:` has at least one `[^N]` reference in body
   - [ ] Run: `grep -o '\[\^[0-9]*\]' reservoir.md | sort -u | wc -l`
   - [ ] Result should be 60 (matching footnote count)

6. **Quality check:**
   - [ ] All numbers consistent across report
   - [ ] Growth calculations updated
   - [ ] No confusion with NFT Reservoir

